# Locales

UI copy comes from `/Users/yaroslav.koval/VSCodeProjects/openvk/locales` (copied to `public/locales`; same as [OpenVK `locales`](https://github.com/OpenVK/openvk/tree/master/locales)). Russian (`ru`) is the source language and the fallback. Do not invent a second catalog for strings that already exist there.

**Keys:** call `locale.t('key')` / `locale.count('base', n)` from `src/stores/locale.svelte.ts`. Reuse OpenVK keys (`header_home`, `my_page`, `log_in`, `select_language`, …). Rewrite-only phrases go in `src/locales/extra.ts` (Russian first, English overlay).

**Detection:** `localStorage['openvk.lang']` if valid, else the first `navigator.languages` tag that maps to a catalog, else `ru`. Persist only when the user picks a language (`/language` or footer flags).

**Picker:** `/language` is `About/Language.latte` — flag grid, Weblate link. Footer shows the first three catalogs plus “all languages”. Guests can open `/language`.
